        "source_text": "All HER measurements were carried out in 1 mol L⁻¹ KOH solution (pH 13.9)... three electrodes system... SCE... graphite rod... LSV test was employed at a scan rate of 2 mV s⁻¹... 95% IR compensation... our MoS₂/Ni₃S₂ NW-NF catalyst only needs overpotentials of 70 and 137 mV for current density of 10 and 100 mA cm⁻²... 182 and 200 mV overpotentials to achieve current density of 500 and 1000 mA cm⁻²... Tafel slope of 58.9 mV dec⁻¹... j₀... 0.63 mA cm⁻²... decreases only by 11, 20 and 23 mV after 12 h tests at 200, 500 and 1000 mA cm⁻²... potential remains almost the same... 150 h... 100 mA cm⁻²"
