        "characterization_summary": "EIS at -135 mV shows much lower Rct for MoS₂/Ni₃S₂ NW-NF than Ni₇S₆ & Ni₃S₂-NF.",
        "evidence_snippet": "the MoS₂/Ni₃S₂ NW-NF catalyst shows much lower Rct than that of Ni₇S₆ & Ni₃S₂-NF."
      },
